# worktree-manager
===
 A simple GUI to manage Git Worktrees. Visual Git Worktree manager for parallel branch development. Multi-repo workspaces, smart symlinks, built-in terminal, browser remote access, and AI-ready MCP integration. Built with Tauri 2 + React + Rust.
